# DocLink Doctor Ignore Patterns

# Local development
localhost
127.0.0.1
0.0.0.0
*.local

# Placeholders and TODOs
*example.com/placeholder*
*TODO*
*FIXME*

# Internal networks
*.internal.company.com
*.corp
10.*.*.*
192.168.*.*

# Specific URLs to ignore
# https://known-flaky-site.com/*

# Regex patterns (prefix with regex:)
# regex:https://api\.example\.com/v\d+/.*

# Ignore by file path
# docs/draft/**
# *.draft.md
